kmem_cache_create 
kmem_cache_alloc
kmem_cache_free
kmem_cache_destroy 

use kmem_cache when to allocate multiple objects of same size .
eg: used in core NW related drivers for fast allocation.
allocation is fast and error occurance can be easly detected.

use mempool along with kmem_cache_* to reserver memory , which will never fail , even in the memory is critically used.
mempool_create_slab_pool() ....  mempool_alloc() ... mempool_free() .... mempool_destroy()

